// ============================================================
// Alloy Theme / Configuration for sandbox_isolation.als
//
// This file configures the Alloy Analyzer to check all assertions
// with the specified scope.  Used by the CLI runner:
//   java -cp alloy.jar edu.mit.csail.sdg.alloy4whole.ExampleUsingTheCompiler \
//         sandbox_isolation.als
//
// Properties verified:
//   1. ResourceContainment    — agents stay within allowlist
//   2. QuarantineCapture      — quarantine logs everything
//   3. NoLateralMovement      — no cross-sandbox resource access
//   4. CrossTenantIsolation   — no cross-tenant resource access
//   5. ToolMediationSafety    — tools respect sandbox boundaries
// ============================================================
